    Fix CLI crash and dropped layers when loading filaments without colours (#16867)

    Filament presets have no `filament_colour`, so loading two or more filaments in the CLI without `--filament-colour` left a one-entry palette. Code that sizes per-filament tables from it then read out of bounds, which crashed the slicer or dropped the layers for filament 2. The CLI now pads `filament_colour` to the filament count and rebuilds the flush matrix. Adds a CLI test that slices a per-layer change to filament 2.

